@startuml Sequence_S3_02_Analytics_Dashboard
' US-S3-02 : Dashboard analytics + export CSV

title US-S3-02 — Tableau de bord analytics et export CSV

actor "Admin\n(Angular)" as AdminUI
participant "AnalyticsController\n/api/analytics" as AnalyticsCtrl
participant "AnalyticsService" as AnalyticsSvc
database "PostgreSQL\n(EF Core)" as DB

== Chargement dashboard ==

AdminUI -> AnalyticsCtrl : GET /api/analytics/dashboard\n?lowStockThreshold=10\n[JWT Admin]
activate AnalyticsCtrl
AnalyticsCtrl -> AnalyticsSvc : GetDashboardAsync(threshold)
activate AnalyticsSvc

AnalyticsSvc -> DB : Agrégats ventes\n(Status NOT IN Pending, Cancelled)
AnalyticsSvc -> DB : Top produits vendus (OrderItems)
AnalyticsSvc -> DB : Produits stock bas
AnalyticsSvc -> DB : Clients fidèles / à forte valeur

AnalyticsSvc --> AnalyticsCtrl : AnalyticsDashboardDTO
deactivate AnalyticsSvc
AnalyticsCtrl --> AdminUI : 200 KPI + tableaux
deactivate AnalyticsCtrl

== Export CSV ==

AdminUI -> AnalyticsCtrl : GET /api/analytics/export/csv\n?lowStockThreshold=10
activate AnalyticsCtrl
AnalyticsCtrl -> AnalyticsSvc : ExportDashboardCsvAsync(threshold)
activate AnalyticsSvc
AnalyticsSvc -> AnalyticsSvc : GetDashboardAsync (mêmes requêtes)
AnalyticsSvc -> AnalyticsSvc : Sérialise métriques en CSV
AnalyticsSvc --> AnalyticsCtrl : byte[]
deactivate AnalyticsSvc
AnalyticsCtrl --> AdminUI : 200 File\nanalytics-dashboard.csv
deactivate AnalyticsCtrl

AdminUI -> AdminUI : Téléchargement navigateur

note over AnalyticsSvc, DB
  Chiffre d'affaires et AOV :
  commandes **Confirmed** + **Shipped** uniquement
end note

@enduml
